window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>No home. No hope. No safe harbors. Just one final clue.</b></p> <p>Castaway on a desert island, Vice has lost everything and everyone. If she's going to live—truly <i>live</i>—she must not only fight to survive but also battle her inner demons. Only then can she escape her island… and her past.</p> <p>Without the woman he loves, Knigh is unraveling like a frayed rope. Around him, the refugee fleet that fled the battle of Nassau is low on food, water, and options. As the Royal Navy closes in, they must keep one step ahead or all they sacrificed will be for nothing.</p> <p>Finding their way back to each other isn't the end of their problems. With thousands of lives at stake, they can't run forever. They need the impossible: a home that's safe from Mercia's vengeance.</p> <p>Maybe, just maybe, the answers lie not in their future, but in the past and its long-lost treasure.</p> <p><i>If you love Sarah J Maas's gut-wrenching romances and the adventure of </i>Pirates of the Caribbean, <i>you'll love the breathtaking conclusion to this new adult fantasy series. Listen to </i>Through Dark Storms <i>and discover a centuries-old mystery, an epic happily ever after, and what else besides the Kraken lurks in the deep.</i></p>"; 
